    "Microsoft.VSTS.Common.AcceptanceCriteria": "<div><b>Acceptance Criteria</b> </div><ul><li><b>Report Type Management</b><ul><li>Each template in the list must display its report type: Master Report, Project Report, Regime Report, or none. </li><li>A user must be able to add a template to, or remove it from, the Master Reports designation from this screen; a template designated as a Master Report must be visible on the Reports tab of every project in the hierarchy. </li><li>Creating or removing a Project Report link (via Manage Inputs) or a Regime Report link (via the Regime Library) is out of scope for this story � this screen only reflects and lets a user filter/search by the resulting type, it does not create those links. </li> </ul> </li> </ul>",
